# Life 2 rebirth through Tensura's reincarnation menu (the Great Sage scene on a real client).
# `ttlrebirth submit` confirms offer 0 as if clicked. Expect: "Test passed" for the open menu check is not
# possible over RCON, so check the log for "[ttl] rebirth: menu opened" and "chose", then phase=life2 with
# a knowledge unique and the race of offer 0 (always slime: Slime is offer 0).
ttlbot spawn TtlBotScene
@sleep 2
kill TtlBotScene
execute as TtlBotScene run ttl wish knowledge
execute as TtlBotScene run ttl rebirth
@sleep 1
ttl inspect TtlBotScene
ttlrebirth submit TtlBotScene 0
@sleep 2
ttl inspect TtlBotScene
ttl reset TtlBotScene
ttlbot remove TtlBotScene
